            <title>3.31.1</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 11:19:00 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>238</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.31.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Bug Fixes
- Choosing "Set up auto mode" in the bypass-permissions dialog now opens Terminal.app and runs Claude Code's auto mode setup in the session's folder. Before, the option reported success and nothing ran.
- If Terminal.app cannot be opened (for example, Canopy is not allowed to control Terminal), the failure is now written to the log instead of being dropped.
]]></description>
