            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Changes
- For a job with several stages (feature matching, then reconstruction, then training), sessions now register the stage that is running and register again as each stage starts, so the ring and finish time follow the current stage instead of sitting at 0% until the last one begins.
